{"id":1000,"date":"2025-12-23T09:00:02","date_gmt":"2025-12-23T08:00:02","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/?p=1000"},"modified":"2025-12-23T09:54:52","modified_gmt":"2025-12-23T08:54:52","slug":"spms-2026-special-session-on-theoretical-and-applied-aspects-of-imprecise-probabilities","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/2025\/12\/23\/spms-2026-special-session-on-theoretical-and-applied-aspects-of-imprecise-probabilities\/","title":{"rendered":"SPMS 2026: Special Session on Theoretical and applied aspects of imprecise probabilities"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The SPMS 2026 conference:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><em>International Conference on Soft Methods in Probability and Statistics 2026<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>will take place from September 15 to 18, 2026, in Lecce, Italy. The practical information about the conference can be found on the SPMS 2026 <a href=\"https:\/\/conference.unisalento.it\/event\/14\/\">website<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Enrique Miranda<\/strong> and <strong>Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez<\/strong> are organising a special session about imprecise probabilities:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><em>Theoretical and applied aspects of imprecise probabilities<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This session is devoted to Imprecise Probability Theory. This theory involves all the mathematical models that can be used as more flexible tools than usual Probability Theory when the available information is scarce, vague or incomplete. It includes lower previsions, n-monotone capacities, belief functions, possibility measures, or non-additive measures, among others.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This special session aims to include papers related to Imprecise Probabilities that either present a significant advance in the foundations or show potential applications in real problems. In addition, papers where the connection between imprecise probability theory and other fields such as fuzzy sets or game theory is emphasised are also welcome.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The SPMS 2026 conference: International Conference on Soft Methods in Probability and Statistics 2026 will take place from September 15 to 18, 2026, in Lecce, Italy. The practical information about the conference can be found on the SPMS 2026 website. Enrique Miranda and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez are organising a special session about imprecise probabilities: Theoretical and&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1001,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"elementor_header_footer","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1000","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sin-categoria"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1000","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1000"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1000\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1008,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1000\/revisions\/1008"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1001"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1000"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1000"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1000"}],"cu